---
title: "Discord OAuth Callback (kintai-v3: Authentication Flow)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_parse_params: GET /auth/callback?code=...
    q_parse_params --> q_check_error: extract code, error, error_description from searchParams
    q_check_error --> q_oauth_error: error param present
    q_oauth_error --> [*]: redirect /login?error={userMessage}
    q_check_error --> q_no_code: no error, no code
    q_no_code --> [*]: redirect /login?error=no auth code
    q_check_error --> q_exchange: code present
    q_exchange --> q_code_exchange: supabase.auth.exchangeCodeForSession(code)
    q_code_exchange --> q_exchange_fail: error in exchange
    q_exchange_fail --> q_flow_state_error: error contains 'flow state'
    q_flow_state_error --> [*]: redirect /login?error=session expired
    q_exchange_fail --> q_generic_error: other error
    q_generic_error --> [*]: redirect /login?error={message}
    q_code_exchange --> q_check_session: exchange success
    q_check_session --> q_no_session: no session or no user in data
    q_no_session --> [*]: redirect /login?error=session failed
    q_check_session --> q_get_discord_uid: session and user present
    q_get_discord_uid --> q_extract_provider: discordUid = user.user_metadata.provider_id
    q_extract_provider --> q_no_discord: discordUid is null
    q_no_discord --> q_signout_no_discord: supabase.auth.signOut()
    q_signout_no_discord --> [*]: redirect /login?error=Discord UID not found
    q_extract_provider --> q_member_check: discordUid present
    q_member_check --> q_query_member: SELECT FROM member.members WHERE discord_uid = discordUid
    q_query_member --> q_member_not_found: error or no record
    q_member_not_found --> q_signout_no_member: supabase.auth.signOut()
    q_signout_no_member --> [*]: redirect /login?error=not_registered
    q_query_member --> q_redirect: member found
    q_redirect --> [*]: redirect to {next} (from cookie or /dashboard)

    note right of q_member_check
        INV-001: Discord server membership check is COMMENTED OUT in production
        INV-002: Only member.members table lookup gates access
        INV-003: auth_next cookie stores post-auth redirect (10min maxAge, httpOnly)
    end note

    note right of q_exchange
        INV-004: Uses PKCE flow (exchangeCodeForSession)
        INV-005: On auth failure, user session is explicitly signed out before redirect
        INV-006: Extensive console.log of auth metadata including first 20 chars of code
    end note
